   "texto": [
    "**Bir, iki, üç, dört, beş, altı, yedi, sekiz, dokuz, on** is from one to ten.",
    "The tens are formed separately: **yirmi** (20), **otuz** (30), **kırk** (40), **elli** (50), **altmış** (60), **yetmiş** (70), **seksen** (80), **doksan** (90).",
